 "summary": "The library Tabs bound to a document variable that three stacked panels (Cards) and PagerDots follow: tapping a tab shows its panel and moves the dot.",
 "prompt": "Make a Day / Week / Month tab bar that switches a summary card below it, with page dots that follow the selected tab.",
